From 6085b635a3c8dc51de157e6ea07f43dfb9b28ace Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:55:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Explore: Personal journeys, and a story page for each

Figma Changes item 2, every design version: a Personal Journeys shelf
on Explore (236x320 story cards, See All at /journeys) and a story page
(/journeys/:slug) with the hero photo, author, date and read time, the
story in sections, a pull quote, the session it is about, a photo
carousel and Try the Session. Olivia's story and every photo come from
the Figma frames; Lucas's is written to the same pattern. Behind
RELEASES.personalJourneys: staging only until shipped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
